"""Small Tkinter front end for shower batch programming."""

# RUNTIME_GUARD_V9: integrated batch grouping, Sent status, live progress, safe close, and single-instance protection.
# UPDATE_UI_BATCH_REVIEW_V11: themed update results, live GitHub progress, safe ZIP staging, and grouped Review / Send batches.
# OUTPUT_CONTROL_AND_BATCH_SELECTION_V12: independent sketch/DXF output, blank-sketch support, and batch-wide selection.
# SKIP_SKETCH_STALE_OUTPUT_FIX_V13: skip mode ignores/removes stale marked sketches and Clear Sketch Memory is recursive.
# SKIP_DXF_STALE_OUTPUT_FIX_V14: Skip DXF removes stale programs, Review/Send ignores them, and Clear Program Memory is recursive.
# CLEAN_SKIP_SKETCH_PREVIEW_FIX_V15: skipped sketches open clean; proposed marks appear only after editing is enabled.
# DXF_REPROCESS_LOCK_GUARD_V16: Process DXF Again checks for open generated programs before replacing them.
# SINGLE_PAGE_WINDOW_GUARD_V17: major review pages reuse one window and accidental double-click launches are blocked.
# WINDOW_FOCUS_REVIEW_COLLAPSE_V22: V18 layout, no overwrite selector, stronger existing-window focus, and error-first Review / Send expansion.
# INPUT_CLEANUP_CORRELATION_V23: full-batch sent/deleted retention and exact A&W PDF/DXF cleanup correlation.
# OUTPUT_MODE_PREVIEW_X_DELETE_V24: clear skip-output routing, removable automatic X-outs, and original-DXF previews.
# JOB_NUMBER_CORRELATION_V25: separate Job Nr/A&W identities and place Mark Checked beside A&W.
# ORDER_OVERVIEW_HEADERS_V27: place Sent beside Processed and add polished drag-grip headers.
# ORDER_OVERVIEW_SIMPLIFICATION_V28: combine Processed/date, remove PDF, and expand Issues.
# EXACT_REVISION_AND_EDIT_HISTORY_V29: exact dotted-revision matching plus transactional Undo/Redo sketch edits.
# PERSISTED_STATUS_AND_SCOPED_MEMORY_V30: restore processed colors and clear only selected-order memory.
# ROTATION_ARROW_ICON_CLARITY_V34: full curved arrows with action-accurate directional heads.
# PPH_DXF_HINGE_SIDE_CONFIRMATION_V35: confirm ambiguous PPH hinge sides from paired DXF radii.
# BILATERAL_SCU4_DENVER_ORIENTATION_V36: flip proven symmetric four-slot panels to the top-right marker.
# FIXED_SIDEBAR_NO_SCROLL_V37: keep all main sidebar controls in one fixed, non-scrolling panel.
# ATOMIC_RUNTIME_SWAP_V39: pre-copy and self-test updates before a fast runtime swap with rollback and visible progress.
# REPORT_BUGS_VERSIONING_V40: visible app version, GitHub bug reporting, centralized release metadata, and changelog tracking.
# PRODUCTION_SKETCH_RECONCILIATION: recognize orders sent by another workstation from the shared Sketches folder.
# REVIEW_ARCHIVE_REMAKE_USABILITY_V94: overview text sizing, archive test restore, readable dialogs, and remake reliability.
# BACKGROUND_RESPONSIVENESS_V95: threaded order cleanup, live cleanup progress, and non-blocking archive settings load.
# FAST_FILTERED_ARCHIVE_BROWSER_V96: seven-day archive paging, batch grouping, date filters, run browsing, and sortable archive columns.
# VISUAL_POLISH_BATCH_ARCHIVE_ACTIONS_V99: polished surfaces, network quick access, and batch-level archive/Test Mode actions.
# OPERATOR_AUDIT_TEST_MODE_POLISH_V100: bordered table headers, isolated batch Test Mode scans, complete order action audit, and history filters.
# TEST_MODE_VISIBILITY_DXF_DISPLAY_V114: persistent Test Mode banner/title state, close-time Test Mode exit, and concise DXF reference decimals.
# ARCHIVE_MULTI_REVISION_XLS_POLISH_V115: deterministic synthetic Test Mode batches, faster XLS normalization, and concise four-decimal DXF reference text.
# SETTINGS_NATIVE_SHELL_TEARDOWN_V102: verified Settings Toplevel destruction with raw Tcl fallback and stale-shell rejection.
# SETTINGS_PERSISTENT_WITHDRAW_V103: Settings closes by hiding the intact Toplevel; non-primary tabs build lazily to avoid fragile destroy recursion.
# SETTINGS_DATA_LIFECYCLE_V104: archive-local progress/error feedback plus reliable archive/history refresh after persistent Settings reopen.
# HISTORY_RANGE_ARCHIVE_POLISH_V105: seven-day/date-windowed Action History, simplified Archives actions, and maximized Settings.
# ACTION_HISTORY_DIAGNOSTICS_V106: repaired Action History tab construction and added visible file/stage diagnostics.
